# System Design

## 1. Introduction

This document describes the design of the Hotel Management System. It provides the system architecture, database design, UML diagrams, and package structure used during development.

---

## 2. System Architecture

The system follows a layered architecture:

Presentation Layer (JavaFX GUI)

↓

Business Logic Layer (Services)

↓

Data Access Layer (DAO)

↓

SQLite Database

### Components

- JavaFX User Interface
- Service Layer
- DAO Layer
- SQLite Database

---

